const form=(fields:FormConfig["fields"])=>n("input","form","업무 입력의 자료형·필수 항목 확인",{description:`필수 입력: ${fields.map(f=>f.label).join(", ")}`,form:{fields}});
const obj=(properties:Record<string,DataSchema>):DataSchema=>({type:"object",properties,required:Object.keys(properties),additionalProperties:false});
const str:DataSchema={type:"string"},bool:DataSchema={type:"boolean"};
const text=(id:string,purpose:string,template:string,bindings:Record<string,InputBinding>={})=>n(id,"transform",purpose,{transform:{mode:"template",template},inputBindings:bindings});
const pick=(id:string,purpose:string,fields:Record<string,string>,bindings:Record<string,InputBinding>)=>n(id,"transform",purpose,{transform:{mode:"pick",fields},inputBindings:bindings});
const condition=(id:string,purpose:string,predicate:NonNullable<FlowNode["predicate"]>,bindings:Record<string,InputBinding>)=>n(id,"condition",purpose,{predicate,inputBindings:bindings});
