const parse=(schema:DataSchema)=>n("parse","transform","JSON 업무 기록을 해석하고 필드 계약 확인",{transform:{mode:"parse_json"},outputSchema:obj({text:str,data:schema})});
const scenario=(name:string,input:unknown,expect:Omit<WorkflowScenario,"name"|"input">):WorkflowScenario=>({name,input:typeof input==="string"?input:JSON.stringify(input),...expect});
const design=(id:string,title:string,behavior:string,definition:Definition,scenarios:WorkflowScenario[]):WorkflowDesign=>({id,title,category:"업무별 독립 실행 설계",description:behavior,behavior,definition,resources:[],scenarios,inputExample:scenarios[0]?.input??"",expectedOutput:(scenarios[0]?.contains??[]).join(" / "),acceptance:definition.nodes.map(node=>`${node.id}: ${node.description}`),failureCases:["필수 값이나 자료형이 틀리면 계산·승인된 결과로 바꾸지 않는다.","외부 발송·주문·계정·원본 자료 변경은 하지 않는다."]});
const model=(id:string,purpose:string,prompt:string,bindings?:Record<string,InputBinding>,schema?:DataSchema)=>n(id,"ai",purpose,{prompt,allowedTools:[],limits:{maxTurns:1,maxTokens:2200,maxToolCalls:1,maxDurationMs:30000},...(bindings?{inputBindings:bindings}:{}),...(schema?{format:"JSON",outputSchema:obj({text:str,data:schema})}:{})});

